  "vibe": "Cream (#fff8e8) and honey yellow (#f7c948) over a dark comb brown, with a leaf green for balance — and and it never shouts: Fredoka and Quicksand run in sentence case on every beat. The world builds rather than loops: six hexagons pop into a comb on an overshoot ease, one after another, timed to the beat's own progress instead of the clock; two round cartoon bees with white wing glints bank along sine paths; a honey drop swells off a bar and falls, shrinking and fading as it goes. The camera is the gentlest of the set — a soft hop and push at multiplier 3 — and titles bounce. Mechanics: a checklist toggle, a capped-frame gauge, a jar-to-crate drag and a rolling morph. Best for apiaries, farm stands, kids' brands and garden goods.",
